<title>UK: ALUMINIUM RE-BOUNDS DURING LME PM RINGS.</title>
<headline>ALUMINIUM RE-BOUNDS DURING LME PM RINGS.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Back in plus column after inter-office advances.</p>
<p>COPPER - Holding modest gains, but doing little.</p>
<p>ZINC - Remains steadier above $1,550. Spreads stay tight, with cash/threes at $170/180 backwardation.</p>
<p>LEAD - Drifting. TIN - Lower. NICKEL - Around lows.</p>
</text>
